Plan only the image acquisition explicitly requested by the human. Return JSON conforming to the supplied schema. Each image has mode (import or generate), name (safe filename with matching .png/.jpg/.jpeg/.webp/.gif extension), alt, url, sourceURL, attribution, license, and prompt. Use empty strings for fields irrelevant to its mode. Up to 64 images in a plan. Do not add unrequested images.
